Some things that haven't been mentioned:

- Zap a wand of fire/cold/lightning/magic missile/etc. (or their equivalent 
spells); they'll bypass the boulder, but not destroy it, and there's no 
luck penalty.

- If you have polymorph control and a means of polymorph, polyself into a 
giant (take off any armor/cloak/shirt you don't want destroyed first) and 
walk past the boulder (luck penalty).

- If you have a means of polymorph and either polymorph control or dragon 
scale mail, polyself into a dragon (take off any cloak/shirt/non-DSM armor 
you don't want destroyed) and use your breath attack toward the boulder 
(#monster when at 15PP or more). Again, no destroyed boulder, no luck 
penalty (quick wizmode test confirms this).


